    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/19/3",
    "published": "2026-11-19T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Make your move, Bart if you're feelin' lucky, that is.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/19/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/f27b1060e9ef0137cf93005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/19/2",
    "published": "2026-11-19T12:02:00.000Z",
