    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/19/0",
    "published": "2026-11-19T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Bobby, please jiggle Grandpa's rat so it looks alive.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/2b007360cdd70137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/4",
    "published": "2026-11-18T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Well, you can just rebuild the fort later, Harold. Phyllis and Shirley are coming over and I'll need the cushions.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/43a84030cdd30137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/3",
    "published": "2026-11-18T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "No caption 2026-11-18-3"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/44929690e24d0137cca4005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/2",
    "published": "2026-11-18T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Aaaaaaaaaa! ... Oh, sorry it's just the dog.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/f4f50f40ea250137cfba005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/1",
    "published": "2026-11-18T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"But on the other hand, Feldman, having the biggest brain among us means that it is mere child's play to subdue you with an ordinary headlock!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/a3d77c00cdd20137c56b005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/18/0",
    "published": "2026-11-18T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"I got a bad feeling about this, Harriet.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/316a94a0e6f90137ce50005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/4",
    "published": "2026-11-17T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "Danook shows off his Swiss Army Rock."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/52ade6e0e92e0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/3",
    "published": "2026-11-17T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "High above the hushed crowd, Rex tried to remain focused. Still, he couldn't shake one nagging thought: He was an old dog and this was a new trick."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/df9ea180e3ae0137cd49005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/2",
    "published": "2026-11-17T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "As a young colt, Mr. Ed was often sent to the hall for speaking out of turn."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/4d876e30e9ee0137cf93005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/1",
    "published": "2026-11-17T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "Snake department stores"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/54aed810ea250137cfba005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/17/0",
    "published": "2026-11-17T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"First that cretin Foster and now that jerk Cummings has instantly evaporated! I tell you, Ms. Goodman, without a doubt, I'm looking at an authentic, full-fledged wishing star!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/b1bb1710e85b0137cedf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/4",
    "published": "2026-11-16T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"My marriage is in trouble, Barbara. You ever tried communicating with a hammerhead?\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/e4475460e92d0137cf47005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/3",
    "published": "2026-11-16T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Well, I'm not sure we can afford stomach insurance right now we're trying to put the kids through the small intestine.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/12aac050d0f70137c652005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/2",
    "published": "2026-11-16T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "Mankind arrives on Earth"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/b02573b0e6f70137ce50005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/1",
    "published": "2026-11-16T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "Suddenly, on a national talk show in front of millions of viewers, Dick Clark ages 200 years in 30 seconds."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/935a82d0e9ef0137cf93005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/16/0",
    "published": "2026-11-16T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "Some anthropologists believe that the discoveries of fire, shelter, and language were almost simultaneous."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/15/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/1a9d11e0d0f70137c652005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/15/1",
    "published": "2026-11-15T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "School for the Mechanically Declined"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/15/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/3afa56b0e85b0137cedf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/15/0",
    "published": "2026-11-15T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"... And please let Mom, Dad, Rex, Ginger, Tucker, me, and all the rest of the family see color.\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/14/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/c03b0bf0d7410137c8a6005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/14/1",
    "published": "2026-11-14T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "No caption 2026-11-14-1"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/14/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/43123210e3af0137cd49005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/14/0",
    "published": "2026-11-14T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"No doubt about it, boys. See these markings on the bottom? This is an Apache pie pan!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/9d90b5e0e3ae0137cd49005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/4",
    "published": "2026-11-13T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "The bribe of Frankenstein"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/d54be720e3ad0137cd49005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/3",
    "published": "2026-11-13T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "And for the rest of his life, the young reptile suffered deep emotional scars."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/dbe6d060d7410137c8a6005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/2",
    "published": "2026-11-13T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "Museums of the future"
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/f8bc2440dcc90137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/1",
    "published": "2026-11-13T12:01:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Look out, Thak! It's a a Dang! Never can pronounce those things!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/0",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/5b7024f0e85c0137cedf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/13/0",
    "published": "2026-11-13T12:00:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Got him, Byron! It's something in the Vespula genus, all right and ooooweeeee does he look mad!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/4",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/e49aaac0ea250137cfba005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/4",
    "published": "2026-11-12T12:04:00.000Z",
    "title": "Despite his repeated efforts to explain things to her, Satan could never dissuade his mother from offering cookies and milk to the accursed."
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/3",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/3a29b420df110137cbaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/3",
    "published": "2026-11-12T12:03:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Wawa!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/2",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/6a602fe0dcca0137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/2",
    "published": "2026-11-12T12:02:00.000Z",
    "title": "\"Open the gate! It's a big wiener dog!\""
  },
  {
    "guid": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/1",
    "image": "https://featureassets.amuniversal.com/assets/ade4b120dcca0137caaf005056a9545d",
    "link": "https://www.thefarside.com/2026/11/12/1",
    "published": "2026-11-12T12:01:00.000Z",
